# ERROR EXAMPLE: SCF convergence failure
# Fe(II) porphine model — open-shell transition metal with near-degenerate states
# Default SCF settings will fail to converge (oscillating energy, no convergence)
# ORCA error: SCF NOT CONVERGED / ORCA terminates with error in SCF gradient
# Fix: Add SlowConv, DIIS, or increase MaxIter; use %scf directresetfreq 1 end
# or switch to TRAH SCF convergence strategy
! UKS B3LYP 6-31G(d) Opt Freq pal16

%maxcore 6000
%scf
  MaxIter 5
end

